-# CABLE PUNCH

Version 1.0

---

# Purpose

The Cable Punch is a unilateral explosive pressing exercise designed to improve horizontal force production, rotational coordination and kinetic-chain efficiency.

Within CAS, it is considered one of the highest-transfer resistance exercises for striking sports.

---

# Philosophy

Punching power is not produced by the arm alone.

Effective striking results from the coordinated transfer of force from the ground, through the lower body and trunk, into the fist.

The Cable Punch reinforces this kinetic chain while allowing progressive overload under controlled conditions.

CAS uses the Cable Punch to improve force production without compromising technical quality.

